# FullExplanationNew

## 1. What this project is

The Human Error is a full-stack cybersecurity training platform that teaches phishing and social engineering awareness using realistic, interactive simulations.

It has two main applications:
- Frontend: React + Vite app where users authenticate, run simulations, play training modules, and view analytics.
- Backend: Express API that generates simulation content and explanations using Gemini (with robust fallback behavior when AI is unavailable).

The platform combines:
- Behavior simulation (fake inbox, fake browser login pages, fake system alerts)
- User profile personalization (role, organization, domain, tools, etc.)
- Behavioral telemetry (interaction logs + hesitation timing)
- Risk scoring and explanation generation
- Persistent storage in Firestore for sessions and generated threat briefings

