## 8. Dashboard analytics

File: src/pages/Dashboard.jsx

Loads session data:
1) Firestore via getUserSimulations(uid)
2) fallback localStorage simulation_results if Firestore empty/fails

Normalizes and sorts sessions by recency.

Computed metrics:
- totalSimulations
- highRiskCount (VERY_HIGH or HIGH)
- lowRiskCount (MEDIUM or LOW)
- averageRiskScore percentage using map:
  - VERY_HIGH -> 0
  - HIGH -> 1
  - MEDIUM -> 2
  - LOW -> 3

Risk-pattern breakdown:
- urgency
- authority
- reward
Derived by examining failed interactions and associated email clues text.

Also computes average hesitation in seconds when available.

Includes session filtering (ALL or specific session key) and CTA buttons for training/simulation navigation.

